<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cenbank adds o/n funds at avg 151.13 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cenbank adds o/n funds at avg 151.13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Thursday that it added liquidity through an overnight repo tender which had an average yield of 151.13 percent.</p>
<p>The minimum accepted yield was 145 percent and 60 percent of the bids on that level were accepted, while maximum accepted yield was 170 percent. The volume of the transactions was not disclosed, and no limit yield was set prior to the tender.</p>
<p>-- John Mastrini, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
